OL,3,GNEWSAWayne and Coleen Rooney climb
OL,4,AWales' highest mountain
OL,5,
OL,6,FEx-England footballer Wayne Rooney and
OL,7,Fhis wife Coleen have climbed Wales'
OL,8,Fhighest mountain following a "rare free
OL,9,Fweekend".
OL,11,FOne of Britain's most famous couples
OL,12,Fposted pictures of their walk up Yr
OL,13,FWyddfa, also known as Snowdon, on
OL,14,FInstagram.
OL,16,F"After a busy week...what do we decide
OL,17,Fto do with our very rare free
OL,18,Fweekend... climb Snowdon," it said.
